HST Office: HST Draw has the ribbon's banner, feature search and keytips, and its own Tệp tin backstage.

HST Draw gets the HST ribbon (hst-ribbon-draw.patch). The banner, the feature search box (Alt+Q) and the
keytips (Alt) were attached only to the Tabbed notebookbar of Writer, Calc and Impress; Draw's now gets
them too. The Tệp tin backstage treated a drawing as "other": its blank document was a text document's
"Văn bản trống" and Lưu thành listed no format. It now knows Draw: HST Draw's amber, "Bản vẽ trống", and
ODF drawing (.odg) for Lưu thành.

- sfx2 NotebookbarTabControl: Draw's notebookbar.ui is a Tabbed HST ribbon.
- sfx2 backstage: BackstageApp::Draw (colour, blank drawing, ODG); strings in hstbackstage.hrc and
  translations/source/vi/sfx2/messages.po (where the tarball and an l10n-filled tree agree).

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
